---
import Section from './Section.astro';
---

<Section id="lodging">
  <h2>Lodging</h2>
  <div>
    <h3>The Shawnee Inn &amp; Golf Resort</h3>
    <p>All of the activities for the weekend will be taking place at the Shawnee In. We encourage guest to stay here Friday and Saturday night so they can have a full weekend of fun with us!</p>
    <p>
      <a href="https://www.shawneeinn.com" target="_blank">shawneeinn.com</a>
    </p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h3>Pocono Inn &amp; Banquet</h3>
    <p>This hotel is only a couple miles down the road from the wedding venue. It would most likely be the most affordable option for guest that are not staying at the Shawnee Inn.</p>
    <p>
      <a href="http://poconoinnsuites.com" target="_blank">poconoinnsuites.com</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</Section>

<style>
  div {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
</style>